ind":"announcement","title":"The Playtest is now LIVE!","summary":"We are proud to present to you the first public version of Counter Ducks! It includes two playable maps: Ducks Eye Lake and Gator Swamp. Currently and temporarily, the game can be played with a maximum of 8 people in any team configuration (4v4, 3v5, etc.). There is also a lobby browser that will allow you to find other ‘hunters’ who are open to playing!Since the last version, we managed to create a system for configuring equipment and abilities in the menu, which allows you to choose your equip","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-15T19:25:01Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183782761","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:24:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4796520-1840944183782754","game_id":"steam-4796520","kind":"announcement","title":"Changes - Version 0.1.3ap","summary":"ChangesSettings & General Changes• Fixed reversed graphics quality settings — High and Low values were swapped.• Configuration values are now refreshed after returning from the game scene to the main menu.Player Interface• Added a contextual information system.• The contextual UI displayed while picking up a duck now always appears in the same location.• Added contextual information for switching the Player Duck's flight mode.• Added numerical slot indicators to items in the weapon and ability s","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-15T19:17:56Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183782754","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:24:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4796520-1839041357029608","game_id":"steam-4796520","kind":"announcement","title":"Public Playtest Sign-ups Are Now Open!","summary":"We're getting ready to launch the first public playtest of Counter Ducks, and you can sign up starting today! To celebrate, here's a quick look at the chaotic action waiting for you. Whether you choose to fight as a duck or a hunter, expect plenty of explosions, teamwork, and hilarious moments. Which side would you choose first: Ducks or Hunters? Join Discord! https://discord.com/invite/4zHtPbGneT","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-24T13:41:53Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839041357029608","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:24:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4796520":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:27:54Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:27:53Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4796520":"2026-10-26T14:27:54Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4796520":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:27:53Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T14:27:53Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:27:53Z"},"5348890":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:27:54Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T14:27:54Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:27:54Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4796520","app_id":4796520,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:58Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"0e8916cd502ba3360fd89d7f669e70ca4c929149324075399aad84b04ca0bac1","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"An asymmetric FPP/TPP shooter with two different game modes. In PvE, hunt ducks solo or in co-op, earn money, and upgrade your gear. In PvP, switch roles and play as a duck against hunters in chaotic 4v4